abstract: >-
  A measured cross-disciplinary state architecture connecting the original
  Mirror Interface and LSPS interaction surface to transformer state paths,
  formal systems, structured matter, physical dynamics and solar mechanics,
  biology, evidence convergence, and a controlled return into AI. The paper
  distinguishes the 72-node Lattice Companion atlas, the recurring Universal
  Data Pattern state relation, the substrate-native experimental method, and
  typed evidence cards used for bounded reporting and return.
